From 83a5de0a96ce1f0ae5f0706737b667861e2cc11a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gabe Lapingcao <mgultra2018@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 25 Aug 2026 00:01:45 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 13/14] [tests/gtest]: update devcontainer configuration with
 gcovr

Introduces an addition setup shell script for configuring the Docker
environment with clang tools, Valgrind, and gcovr, and a shell script
for running gcovr with options for coverage on FRR's bgpd or lib
directories, along with the option to cover the Google Test executable.

Signed-off-by: Gabe Lapingcao <mgultra2018@gmail.com>
